---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const updated = "10 August 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | EV Charging Station Nepal"
  description="Terms governing use of EV Charging Station Nepal’s EV charging station map, listings, and related website content."
  canonical="/terms/"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[820px] px-6 py-12">
    <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] text-charge uppercase">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="font-display mb-3 text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)] font-extrabold tracking-tight">
      Terms of Use
    </h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">1. Acceptance</h2>
        <p>
          By using EV Charging Station Nepal, you agree to these Terms of Use and our
          <a href="/privacy/" class="text-charge hover:underline"> Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not
          agree, please do not use the site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">2. Informational service</h2>
        <p>
          Station locations, plugs, amenities, phone numbers, and related details are provided for
          general information. Charging availability, pricing, opening hours, and connector status
          can change without notice. Always confirm with the station operator before relying on a
          listing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">3. No warranty</h2>
        <p>
          The website is provided “as is” without warranties of any kind, express or implied,
          including accuracy, completeness, or fitness for a particular purpose. We are not
          responsible for third-party charging networks, roads, maps, or navigation apps.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">4. Acceptable use</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>Do not misuse the site, scrape aggressively, or disrupt service.</li>
          <li>Do not attempt unauthorized access to systems or data.</li>
          <li>Do not submit unlawful, misleading, or harmful content via contact channels.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">5. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          Site design, branding, and original content belong to EV Charging Station Nepal or its licensors.
          Map tiles and third-party marks belong to their respective owners.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">6. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent allowed by law, EV Charging Station Nepal is not liable for indirect,
          incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the directory, including missed
          charges, travel delays, or reliance on outdated listings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">7. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms periodically. Continued use after changes means you accept the
          revised terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">8. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions:
          <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-charge hover:underline"> Contact us </a>
          or mailto
          <a href="mailto:biplovestha290@gmail.com" class="font-semibold text-charge hover:underline"
            > biplovestha290@gmail.com</a
          >.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
